      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unfortunately this is majorly a culture problem on VRChat, so I believe the Devs can't really do anything (at least directly) to fix this behavior without net negative consequence.  Whenever you run into someone using a NSFW avatar, you can record the incident (make sure nameplates are on) and submit a ticket.  You can do that by joining the VRChat Discord and going to the #moderation-reports channel and going to the link that takes you to the ticketing system.  A simple recording of the incident will be enough for them to get moderated.  ALSO don't be scared to be generous with the block button if you aren't already",
